# Project structure

Follow `.agents/skills/project-structure/SKILL.md` when adding features or placing files.

Hard rules:

- kebab-case **files and folders**; PascalCase **component imports**
- `src/routes/` is **only** for thin route files (`+page.svelte`, `+layout.svelte`, `+page.ts`)
- Screens and business logic live in `src/features/<feature>/`
- App chrome lives in `src/layouts/<name>-layout/`
- Shared app UI lives in `src/components/`; pure logic in `src/lib/`
- Route paths are composed in `src/configs/routes.ts` from `CONSTANTS.ROUTES`
- Prefer `type` over `interface`; use Svelte 5 runes (`$state`, `$derived`, `$effect`, `$props`)
